{
  "message": "I'm sorry, but I can't remove or cancel travel insurance on an existing reservation, and no refund is available for the insurance portion on its own. The policy only allows insurance to be added at the time of initial booking, and there is no procedure or tool to remove it afterwards. Refunds only apply when a whole flight reservation is cancelled.

For reference, the insurance you purchased remains useful: it enables a full refund of the reservation if you need to cancel the flight for health or weather reasons.

If you do want to cancel the entire flight reservation, I can help with that. I would need: (1) your user id, (2) your reservation id (I can look it up if you don't have it), and (3) the reason for cancellation (change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other)."
}

